/span><span begin="00:32.902" end="00:33.174">'bout </span><span begin="00:33.174" end="00:33.398">for </span><span begin="00:33.398" end="00:33.646">like </span><span begin="00:33.646" end="00:33.968">five </span><span begin="00:33.968" end="00:34.574">weeks</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.776" end="00:37.042"><span begin="00:34.776" end="00:34.992">Wonder </span><span begin="00:34.992" end="00:35.168">if </span><span begin="00:35.168" end="00:35.344">he's </span><span begin="00:35.344" end="00:35.688">thinking </span><span begin="00:35.688" end="00:35.887">'bout </span><span begin="00:35.887" end="00:36.090">it </span><span begin="00:36.090" end="00:36.258">too </span><span begin="00:36.258" end="00:36.466">and </span><span begin="00:36.466" end="00:37.042">smiling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.544" end="00:40.537"><span begin="00:37.544" end="00:37.777">Wonder </span><span begin="00:37.777" end="00:37.968">if </span><span begin="00:37.968" end="00:38.170">he </span><span begin="00:38.170" end="00:38.433">knows </span><span begin="00:38.433" end="00:38.634">that </span><span begin="00:38.634" end="00:38.824">that's </span><span begin="00:38.824" end="00:39.065">been </span><span begin="00:39.065" end="00:39.257">what's </span><span begin="00:39.257" end="00:39.688">inspiring </span><span begin="00:39.688" end="00:40.537">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.770" end="00:44.314"><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.970">Wonder </span><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.154">if </span><span begin="00:41.154" end="00:41.354">he's </span><span begin="00:41.354" end="00:41.722">judging </span><span begin="00:41.722" end="00:41.930">me </span><span begin="00:41.930" end="00:42.125">like </span><span begin="00:42.125" end="00:42.433">I </span><span begin="00:42.433" end="00:42.626">am </span><span begin="00:42.626" end="00:42.826">right </span><span begin="00:42.826" end="00:44.314">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.658" end="00:46.020"